Default P2 UDP ports on the radio are:\r\na) Port 1024 into the radio - discovery and general port, this can not be changed\r\nb) Others into the radio 1025-1029 - these can be changed\r\nc) The radio will also use its own output ports 1024-1041 which direct data to the single PC listen port - these can be changed\r\n\r\nIf the [inform hardware of ports to use] is unchecked, on a router/modem you would port forward as follows\r\n    WANip:1024-1029 > radioip:1024-1029\r\n    you would connect to a specific radio in this case using Thetis as WANip:1024\r\n\r\n    you may want to use different external ports, this would also work\r\n    WAN:51000-51005 > radioip:1024-1029\r\n    you would connect to a specific radio in this case using Thetis as WANip:51000\r\n    \r\n    and the radio would also direct everything form its own ports 1025-1041 to the listen port\r\n\r\nIf the [inform hardware of ports to use] is checked you could do the following\r\n    WANip:6000 > radioip:1024   (as 1024 can no be changed on the radio)\r\n    WANip:6001-6005 > radioip:6001-6005   (the radio is told of the 6000 base and now offsets its port expectation)\r\n    you would connect to a specific radio in this case using Thetis as WANip:6000\r\n    \r\n    and the radio would also direct everything form its own ports 6001-6018 to the listen port\r\n\r\nIn all cases, if the client Thetis is behind another modem/router, then the listen port should be port forwarded back directly to the PC ip.=电台的默认 P2 UDP 端口为：\r\na) 端口 1024 进入电台 - 发现和通用端口，此端口不可更改\r\nb) 其他进入电台的端口 1025-1029 - 这些可以更改\r\nc) 电台还将使用自己的输出端口 1024-1041，将数据导向单个 PC 监听端口 - 这些可以更改\r\n\r\n若未勾选[告知硬件要使用的端口]，在路由器/调制解调器上您需要如下端口转发\r\n    WANip:1024-1029 > radioip:1024-1029\r\n    此时您使用 Thetis 连接特定电台，地址为 WANip:1024\r\n\r\n    您也可以使用不同的外部端口，同样有效\r\n    WAN:51000-51005 > radioip:1024-1029\r\n    此时您使用 Thetis 连接特定电台，地址为 WANip:51000\r\n    \r\n    电台还会将其自身端口 1025-1041 的所有数据导向监听端口\r\n\r\n若勾选了[告知硬件要使用的端口]，您可以这样做\r\n    WANip:6000 > radioip:1024   （电台上的 1024 不可更改）\r\n    WANip:6001-6005 > radioip:6001-6005   （电台被告知 6000 基础端口，并相应偏移其端口预期）\r\n    此时您使用 Thetis 连接特定电台，地址为 WANip:6000\r\n    \r\n    电台还会将其自身端口 6001-6018 的所有数据导向监听端口\r\n\r\n在所有情况下，如果客户端 Thetis 位于另一个调制解调器/路由器之后，监听端口应直接端口转发回 PC 的 IP。
