Peak=峰值
Peak bin value in passband\r\n\r\nThis implementation replicates Simon Brown's S-meter approach\r\nin SDR Console. The original Thetis meters are signal power meters that\r\ndisplay the integrated (total) passband power. In contrast, this meter\r\nimplementation only uses the max bin within the passband for its reading.\r\n\r\nConsequently, this method may introduce inaccuracy due to misalignment between\r\nthe signal and the FFT bin grid, and may result in an unstable S-meter.\r\nWindowing will affect the reading, and only the peak bin is considered, ignoring\r\nall other power within the passband. In contrast, the standard meters integrate\r\ntotal power across the passband, which is equivalent to a DC detector measuring\r\nfiltered RF bandwidth in an analogue radio.=通带内峰值分档\r\n\r\n此实现复刻了 Simon Brown 在 SDR Console 中的 S 表方法。\r\n原版 Thetis 仪表是信号功率表，\r\n显示通带的积分（总）功率。相比之下，此仪表\r\n实现仅使用通带内的最大分档作为读数。\r\n\r\n因此，此方法可能因信号与 FFT 分档网格不对齐而产生误差，\r\n并可能导致 S 表不稳定。\r\n加窗会影响读数，且仅考虑峰值分档，\r\n忽略通带内的所有其他功率。相比之下，标准仪表积分\r\n整个通带的总功率，相当于模拟收音机中测量\r\n滤波后射频带宽的直流检波器。
