You can send midi commands to your controller when some events occur.\r\n\r\nWhen NOT in setup Buttons that are mapped to commands that toggle (i.e. command that have On or Off in their name ) the down event fires the first time the button is pressed, the up event fires the second time the button is pressed.\r\n\r\nExample. To turn Hercules RMX right cue LED on when the button is down you would enter in the Button Down Event box:  BX247F X=will be substituted with the correct channel value. All other values MUST be in hexedecimal. Only Midi short messages can be sent.\n\nSS=Status YY=ControlId VV=Value C=channel. SSYYVV will send the current command back to the controller.=发生某些事件时，可以向控制器发送 MIDI 命令。\n\n在非设置状态下，映射到切换命令（即名称中含有 On 或 Off 的命令）的按钮：第一次按下按钮触发按下事件，第二次按下触发抬起事件。\n\n示例：要在按钮按下时点亮 Hercules RMX 右监听 LED，请在“按钮按下事件”框中输入：BX247F X 将被替换为正确的通道值。其他所有值必须为十六进制。只能发送 MIDI 短消息。\n\nSS=状态 YY=控件ID VV=值 C=通道。SSYYVV 将把当前命令发送回控制器。
